{"title":"베텔기우스","artist":"유우리","sourceId":"reference:mYxDDwkY8Q0EGUIk43dT","sourceHash":"c6f45337544bb3b382df39f67e1341c2c4553de943036dd01bd6963d50225d30","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":25952969,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.05,"end":6.25,"text":"空にある何かを見つめてたら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":6.25,"end":11.88,"text":"それは星だって君がおしえてくれた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":11.88,"end":17.02,"text":"まるでそれは僕らみたいに 寄り添ってる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":17.02,"end":22.72,"text":"それを泣いたり笑ったり繋いでいく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":22.72,"end":28.13,"text":"何十回 何百回 ぶつかりあって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":28.13,"end":33.49,"text":"何十年 何百年 昔の光が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":33.49,"end":38.43,"text":"星自身も忘れたころに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":38.43,"end":43.2,"text":"僕らに届いてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":43.2,"end":48.42,"text":"僕ら見つけあって 手繰りあって 同じ空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":48.42,"end":53.73,"text":"輝くのだって 二人だって 約束した","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":53.73,"end":59.18,"text":"遥か遠く終わらないべテルギウス","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":59.18,"end":64.57,"text":"誰かに繋ぐ魔法","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":64.57,"end":69.76,"text":"僕ら 肩並べ 手取り合って 進んでく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":69.76,"end":75.19,"text":"辛い時だって 泣かないって 誓っただろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":75.19,"end":80.43,"text":"遥か遠く終わらないべテルギウス","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":80.43,"end":89.17,"text":"君にも見えるだろう 祈りが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":89.17,"end":94.36,"text":"記憶を辿るたび 蘇るよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":94.36,"end":99.75,"text":"君がいつだってそこに居てくれること","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":99.75,"end":105.03,"text":"まるでそれは星の光と 同じように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":105.03,"end":110.75,"text":"今日に泣いたり笑ったり繋いでいく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":110.75,"end":116.14,"text":"何十回 何百回 ぶつかりあって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":116.14,"end":121.3,"text":"何十年 何百年 昔の光が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":121.3,"end":126.46,"text":"僕自身も忘れたころに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":126.46,"end":131.37,"text":"僕らを照らしてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":131.37,"end":136.41,"text":"僕ら見つけあって 手繰りあって 同じ空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":136.41,"end":141.69,"text":"輝くのだって 二人だって 約束した","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":141.69,"end":147.15,"text":"遥か遠く終わらないべテルギウス","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":147.15,"end":152.91,"text":"誰かに繋ぐ魔法","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":152.91,"end":158.32999999999998,"text":"どこまで いつまで 生きられるか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":158.32999999999998,"end":162.91,"text":"君が不安になるたびに強がるんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":162.91,"end":168.37,"text":"大丈夫 僕が横にいるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":168.37,"end":173.89,"text":"見えない線を繋ごう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":173.89,"end":179.09,"text":"僕ら見つけあって 手繰りあって 同じ空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":179.09,"end":184.39,"text":"輝くのだって 二人だって 約束した","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":184.39,"end":189.72,"text":"遥か遠く終わらないべテルギウス","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":189.72,"end":195.23,"text":"誰かに繋ぐ魔法","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":195.23,"end":200.48,"text":"僕ら 肩並べ 手取り合って 進んでく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":200.48,"end":205.75,"text":"辛い時だって 二人だって 誓っただろう","translation"